---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import WikiTOC from "../../../components/WikiTOC.astro";
import WikiInfoBox from "../../../components/WikiInfoBox.astro";
import WikiAccordion from "../../../components/WikiAccordion.astro";
import WikiGallery from "../../../components/WikiGallery.astro";
import { getWikiEntry } from "../../../data/wikiEntries";

const wikiEntry = getWikiEntry("gizmanta");
---
<!-- Load Base Layout -->
<BaseLayout title="Wiki - RaccStarLogan" description="A collection of information about me, my work, and other random stuff.">
  <meta slot="head" name="wiki:type" content={wikiEntry.meta.type.toLowerCase()} />
  <meta slot="head" name="wiki:tags" content={wikiEntry.meta.tags.join(",")} />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/wiki.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href={wikiEntry.stylesheet} />
  <div class="wiki-page-grid">
        <aside class="wiki-sidebar">
      <h2>Info box</h2>
      <WikiGallery 
        ariaLabel="Gizmanta Gallery"
        images={[
            {
                src: "https://media.raccstarlogan.com/wiki/assets/gizmanta.png",
                alt: "Gizmanta the Protogen",
                caption: "Gizmanta is a raccoon-like protogen with a brown blazer and pearl-white armor. He has red and blue accents."
            }
        ]} />
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th>Aliases / Nicknames</th>
            <td>
              <ul>
                <li>@G1ZM0_PR0T0</li>
                <li>Gizmo</li>
                <li>Giz</li>
                <li>Gizzy</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Birthday</th>
            <td>March 1</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Gender</th>
            <td>Male</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Pronouns</th>
            <td>he/they</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Height</th>
            <td>6 ft / 183 cm</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Orientation</th>
            <td>Aroace</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Species</th>
            <td>Raccoon-like Common Protogen</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Occupation</th>
            <td>I.T. Consultant</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Operating System</th>
            <td>Windows Server 2003 R2 - Build 3790.2721</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Hobbies</th>
            <td>
              <ul>
                <li>Engineering</li>
                <li>Programming</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Favorite Foods</th>
            <td>
              <ul>
                <li>Computer parts?????</li>
                <li>Thermal paste</li>
                <li>Oil</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Likes</th>
            <td>
              <ul>
                <li>Technology</li>
                <li>Paperclips</li>
                <li>Internet</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Dislikes</th>
            <td>
              <ul>
                <li>Misinformation</li>
                <li>Worms</li>
                <li>Water</li>
                <li>sudo rm -rf /</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <br/>
      <h2>More links</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={wikiEntry.href + "/gallery"}>Gallery</a></li>
        {wikiEntry.referencePackUrl && (
          <li><a href={wikiEntry.referencePackUrl} download>{wikiEntry.referencePackLabel ?? "Download References (.zip)"}</a></li>
        )}
      </ul>
    </aside>

        <main id="wiki-content" class="article-section">
    <h1>Gizmanta</h1>

    <WikiInfoBox title="Quote" variant="info">
      <p>"<b>ERROR 404:</b> Couldn't find the part where I asked."</p>
      <audio controls style="width: 100%;">
        <source src="https://media.raccstarlogan.com/wiki/assets/voices/gizmanta.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
        Your browser does not support the audio element.
      </audio>
      <p class="wiki-gallery-caption">- Gizmanta</p>
    </WikiInfoBox>

    <p><strong>Gizmanta</strong> is not canon to the <a href="/wiki/redrift">REDRIFT</a> universe, I just wanted to make a protogen character. There's honestly not a lot to say about him. However, I'll still humor you, reader. Here's a bunch of bullshit about this clanker.</p>

    <div class="wiki-toc-wrapper"><WikiTOC /></div>

    <h2 id="section-1">Appearance</h2>
    <p>Gizmanta is a sleek, raccoon-like common protogen with cool gray fur and darker gray markings on his paws and tail. His displays show two colors, those being blue and red. His accents (inner ears, paw pads and claws) are asymmetrical, mirroring his screen colors opposite of each side.</p>
    <p>He typically only wears a brown blazer alongside his usual protogen armor, which is a pearl white color. On his chestplate, you can see a very subtle power indicator light which flashes white when turned on, red when low on battery, and blue when charging.</p>

    <h2 id="section-2">Personality</h2>
    <p>Gizmanta is commonly described as a nerd, but that's no insult! He's very knowledgable and surprisingly fast with math. Which isn't surprising considering he's literally a computer and has the knowledge of the entire internet at his disposal.</p>
    <p>He doesn't exactly get most jokes; he tends to take things too literally. His own jokes are about as cheesy as any "personal assistant" on your phone or computer or LLM would make.</p>

    <h2 id="section-3">History</h2>
    <p>Gizmanta was created in a lab from a sample of <a href="/wiki/logan-foster">Logan</a>'s DNA. The reasoning behind this has since been forgotten, but hey, he exists, and that's all that really matters.</p>
    <p>Nowadays, he exists as a quiet presence in the background; helpful, nerdy, and slightly out of sync with social cues.</p>

    <h2 id="section-4">Abilities</h2>
    <p>TODO</p>

    <h2 id="section-5">Relationships</h2>
    <p>TODO</p>

    <h2 id="section-6">Trivia</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Because he was made from Logan's DNA, the two are basically cousins.</li>
      <li>His name is a combination of "gizmo" and "antonio", the latter being the name of the scientist behind his creation.</li>
      <li>His voice is basically just the default voice that comes with desktop assistants like Bonzi Buddy from the early 2000s.</li>
      <li>His favorite programming language is Assembly. How? Don't ask me.</li>
      <li>He is surprisingly good at cooking, and often experiments with new recipes in his free time.</li>
    </ul>
    <br/>
  </main>
</div>
</BaseLayout>

